{"sourceUrl":"https://lfc.njau.edu.cn/info/1085/2633.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:55.397729+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://lfc.njau.edu.cn/info/1085/2633.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>为营造良好的学术氛围，促进全国</span><span>生物</span><span>科学类专业优秀大学生的交流，加深学生对南京农业大学生命科学学院相关学科的了解，</span><span>南京农业大学生命科学学院</span><span>将在</span></span><span>2025</span><span><span>年</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>9-10</span><span><span>日举办优秀大学生暑期夏令营，</span><span>欢迎符合条件的同学积极报名参加。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>一、学院介绍</span></p>\n<p><span><span>    南京农业大学于</span></span><span>2002</span><span><span>年</span></span><span>10</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>20</span><span><span>日整合植物学、微生物学、生物化学与分子生物学、动物学四个学系正式成立生命科学学院。学院依托的生物学学科最早可追溯到</span></span><span>1921 </span><span><span>年原国立</span><span>东南大学农科秉志、胡先骕等创建的中国第一个生物系。微生物学、植物学等学科分别由樊庆笙、李扬汉、朱健人等在上世纪</span></span><span>50 </span><span><span>年代创建，并于</span></span><span>1981 </span><span><span>年和</span></span><span>1986</span><span><span>年获得博士学位授权点；</span></span><span>2000</span><span><span>年生物学一级</span><span>学科获</span><span>批博士学位授权点。目前，生命科学学院包含植物生物学系、微生物学系、生物化学与分子生物学系、动物生物学系</span></span><span>4</span><span><span>个学系和国家级农业生物学虚拟仿真实验教学中心</span></span><span>/</span><span><span>生物学实验教学中心</span></span><span>/</span><span><span>生命科学实验中心。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>学院拥有雄厚的教学和科研师资力量。全院教职员工</span><span>142</span><span><span>人，其中专任教师</span></span><span>96</span><span><span>人（教授</span></span><span>44</span><span><span>人、副教授</span></span><span>46</span><span><span>人；博士生导师</span></span><span>42</span><span><span>人、硕士生导师</span></span><span>83</span><span><span>人），</span></span><span>99%</span><span><span>的专任教师具有博士学位，</span></span><span>43%</span><span><span>教师具有海外</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>年以上访学经历。学院拥有国家</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>杰出青年科学基金</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>获得者、国家级教学名师、享受</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>国家政府特殊津贴</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>教授、教育部</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>新世纪百千万人才工程</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>、江苏省</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span>333</span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>第二层次人才、</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>高校青年教师奖</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>获奖者</span><span>、国家</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>四青</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>人才、教育部新世纪优秀人才、农业农村</span><span>部岗位</span><span>科学家、江苏省</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>杰出青年科学基金</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>获得者，江苏省特聘教授</span><span>等国家、省部级人才</span></span><span>20</span><span><span>余人。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>    学院围绕农业生物学前沿科学问题与国家重大需求，产出了一批基础研究成果和应用成果。近年来，在</span><span>Science, Nature Plants, Nature Food, Nature Communications PNAS</span><span><span>，等国际知名杂志上发表</span></span><span>SCI</span><span><span>论文</span></span><span>700</span><span><span>余篇，为我校</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>生物和生物化学</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>微生物学</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>植物与动物学</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>环境科学与生态学</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>等学科进入</span></span><span>ESI</span><span><span>前</span></span><span>1%</span><span><span>、</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>‰</span></span><span><span>或</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>‱</span></span><span><span>作出</span><span>重要贡献；获得国家科技进步二等奖、教育部自然科学二等奖、教育部科技进步二等奖等奖励多项。</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>农药残留微生物降解菌剂</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>获国家级重点新产品；</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>生物除草剂</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>系列产品实现规模化应用；</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>氢气在农业中的应</span><span>用</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>获法国</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>液化空气奖</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>        学院建有农业农村部农业环境微生物</span><span>重点实验室、教育部</span><span>“</span><span>农田土壤健康与绿色生产学科创新引智基地</span><span>”</span><span>、国家农业环境微生物种质资源库、江苏省杂草控制工程技术研究中心、江苏省农业微生物种质资源库等平台，参与作物遗传与种质创新利用全国重点实验室和农村土地资源利用与整治国家地方联合工程研究中心等国家平台建设。学院建有</span><span>“</span><span>生命科学实验中心</span><span>”</span><span>校级科研共享平台，拥有扫描电镜、透射电镜、活细胞激光共聚焦显微镜、高分辨轨道</span><span>阱</span><span>质谱仪、</span><span>液质联用</span><span>仪等各类大中型仪器设备四十多台（套），仪器设备总价值超</span></span><span>5000</span><span><span>余万元。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>二、</span><span>时间地点</span> </p>\n<p><span>    2025</span><span><span>年</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>9-10</span><span><span>日，线下</span><span>线上同步进行</span><span>，具体日程安排另行通知。欢迎</span><span>南京本地院校营员线下参加。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>三、报名条件 </span></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span><span>、</span><span>达到或接近所在高校免试推荐硕士研究生要求的国内全日制</span></span><span>2022</span><span><span>级在校生，以及准备报考我院的全国重点高校本科生，具有生物科学</span><span>、生物技术</span><span>等相关学科背景（不限于）</span><span>；</span></span> </p>\n<p><span>2</span><span><span>、具有良好的思想品德和政治素养，身心健康，</span><span>有较强的科研潜力</span><span>；</span></span> </p>\n<p><span>3</span><span><span>、</span><span>学习成绩优秀，在校期间总成绩专业排名前</span></span><span>20%</span><span><span>，在科研训练或各类学科竞赛中有突出成绩者优先（如已在重要学术期刊上发表论文、获得省级以上竞赛奖项）</span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4</span><span><span>、英语成绩优秀，英语四级</span></span><span>460</span><span><span>分以上或英语六级</span></span><span>425</span><span><span>分以上或具有其他同等级别英语水平证明；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5</span><span><span>、</span><span>欢迎</span><span>本校</span><span>优秀</span><span>学生报名参加。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>四、</span><span>报名方式及材料</span> </p>\n<p><span><span>    有意报名的同学将报名材料电子稿报送学院联系人，并申请加入夏令营</span></span><span>QQ</span><span><span>群。（注意：邮件名称以</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>姓名</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>学校名称</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>报名材料</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>命名，邮件中文件名称以</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>姓名</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>学校名称</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>专业</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>命名。）</span></span></p>\n<p><span>    1. </span><span><span>以下申请材料请于</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>30</span><span><span>日</span></span><span> 17:00</span><span> </span><span><span>前按标号顺序做成一个</span></span><span>PDF</span><span><span>文件和夏令营申请汇总表电子版（附件</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>），一并发送至邮箱：</span></span><span>cyn@njau.edu.cn</span><span><span>：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span><span>）夏令营报名表（附件</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span><span>）本科阶段成绩单扫描件（须加盖教务处或院系公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>3</span><span><span>）英语水平证明扫描件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>4</span><span><span>）其他证明材料扫描件（如已发表录用论文、各类获奖或资格证书）。</span></span> </p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span><span>联系方式：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>联</span> <span><span>系</span></span> <span><span>人：陈老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span>联系电话：</span><span>025-84395869</span></p>\n<p><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span><span>cyn@njau.edu.cn</span></p>\n<p><span>QQ</span><span><span>群：</span></span><span>766198362</span></p>\n<p><span><span>地址：江苏省南京市玄武</span><span>区卫岗</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>号</span><span>，南京农业大学生命科学学院</span></span> </p>\n<p><span><span>五、审核录取</span></span> </p>\n<p><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>3</span><span><span>日前对报名材料进行审核，择优录取。录取名单及活动安排将于在南京农业大学生命科学学院网站上公布并以</span></span><span>QQ</span><span><span>、电话短信（电话号码务必准确并保持畅通）等形式通知申请者本人，未入选者不另行通知；入选者如有变更，不能参加夏令营，</span><span>请第一时间</span><span>告知主办方。</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>六、注意事项</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span><span>.</span><span><span>申请者可到南京农业大学生命科学学院主页获取更多学科建设及导师信息。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span>. </span><span><span>参加暑期夏令营的学生在夏令营期间应遵守南京农业大学的相关规定，按照统一的安排参加活动。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span></span><span>.</span><span><span>一经发现申请者申报材料有虚假内容，立即取消申请人资格，并保留追责的权利。</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>                                                                                   生命科学学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>                                                                                        <span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>26</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<span><span><br/></span></span>\n<p></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"8e1cf473fed21324aa84bc2dc8243dde92446bee1b14c237d8850ca4854e77fa","textLength":2107,"sourceSha256":"8c4e5033855e8156e1d86ded37f5996083e4098a03ba6196b2ef9944ead0d7f6","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1-南京农业大学生命科学学院2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营报名表.docx","url":"https://lfc.njau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1311733013&wbfileid=15549037"},{"name":"附件2-生科院2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营申请汇总表.xlsx","url":"https://lfc.njau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1311733013&wbfileid=15549039"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ee98458a2540027ef6ca","title":"2025年南京农业大学生命科学学院2025年优秀大学生暑期夏令营招募公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:55.397729+00:00"}
